msgstr "The TwoFactorAuth module is active. Both modules replace the login controller, so they cannot run together. Disable TwoFactorAuth first."

msgid "Two-factor authentication is required for your role. Set it up to continue."
msgstr "Two-factor authentication is required for your role. Set it up to continue."

