msgstr "Enter the 6-digit code from your authenticator app to finish logging in."

msgid "Enter the code your app shows now. This proves the app was set up correctly before it becomes required to log in."
msgstr "Enter the code your app shows now. This proves the app was set up correctly before it becomes required to log in."

